# Copy to .env.local for local work (never commit .env.local).
# PostHog main project key (a public client key, EU cloud, vault entry "Posthog Landingpage Key"). Read at BUILD time and
# inlined into the site. Without it there is no tracking, no cookie banner and no "Cookie settings" link in the footer
# (which is what you normally want locally). In production it is a Cloudflare build variable, for production builds only.
PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY=
